{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-12_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-11","title":"深埋地底","storyCode":"16-12","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"03e700c76614e00663667b603b321573c8b5fa7214b019d27e736baf1c8c79f2","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在由“奧卡”構成的瀑布前，Mon3tr發現了這種流體的本質。博士在礦洞中捕捉到了普瑞賽斯邀請自己繼續“辯論”的意圖。而在礦洞更深處，變異的裂獸發出了嘶吼。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是第一次發現“奧卡”的礦洞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理說，在那不久之後這裡就被嚴格控管了……但是現在看來，感覺像是完全廢棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，好消息是礦洞裡的活性源石粉塵含量也在停工後迅速下降了，只要不直接接觸失去活性的源石結晶，不會有太大的感染風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我沒有偵測到別的生命訊號——看來不用打架就可以進去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們尚不清楚這裡是什麼情況。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"糾察隊和衛兵隨時都有可能回來。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"把握時間。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們快去快回。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭，你確定是這個方向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我什麼也沒看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只下來過一次……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我先找一下緊急能源開關的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g5_deepmine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，看來沒錯。接下來繼續往礦車行駛的反方向走就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反方向？我以為我們要往更深處前進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面連接的是其他地方，並不是礦洞。我也不知道那邊到底是做什麼的，但應該只送貨物過去而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦車呢？還能用嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦車本身沒有問題，但被擱置太久了，緊急能源應該只能夠提供照明，我們還是不去嘗試比較好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒錯。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們走下去就可以了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們兩個，上去礦車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"礦車裡沒有安全帶！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們可以自己走下去！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上去礦車，博士。這樣節省時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但礦車無法啟動——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別擔心，我來解決。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，需要我扶你上去嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……我自己來！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是，Mon3tr小姐，你準備做什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——呃？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們絕對會被晃飛出去。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"礦車絕對會被你搞到解體的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"保證不會的，你們坐穩就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們要出發了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還好，礦洞看起來還算正常，沒有出現坍塌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過……下來之前我們應該先烤一下火的。礦洞深處的濕度比外面還高，差距就好比伊比利亞沿海和烏薩斯內陸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然，礦井內外的溫差也很大……你們感覺還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我當然沒什麼問題了。博士呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感覺……感覺我的腦漿被搖得很均勻。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"Mon3tr，你好像玩得很開心！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我控制速度了啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr小姐是一位很好的駕駛員，或者說推車工人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼，看來不是我的問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"科謝尼婭，我有一個問題。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"礦區第一次發現“奧卡”是什麼時候？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"詳細時間我並不清楚，在一個月前，第一份“奧卡”的樣本才被送到研究所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那也是我知道源石礦井中出現這種……聞所未聞的新物質的時刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是很奇怪……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"像這種礦井中出現的物質……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"研究所是如何把它和“人體實驗”連結在一起的？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在這個發現了“奧卡”的礦洞裡，感染者出現了匪夷所思的異變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的感染程度奇高無比的同時，卻保持著正常的生命徵象，甚至算得上“健康”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"症狀聽起來很熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們在別的地方也遇到了這樣的病人？他們也接觸過“奧卡”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許還有別的可能。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我們還不能確定……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"總之……烏薩斯官方想要複製這樣的“奇蹟”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，他們是想要不懼病痛、不會反抗的勞動力，甚至是……另一種特殊的軍隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"烏薩斯官方會有這樣的反應並不令人意外……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他們還沒有意識到這樣做有什麼危害。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士、科謝尼婭，我們好像快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"礦車的軌道就到這裡了，接下來我們得步行了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人摸黑徒步向前走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"比光線先進入知覺的依然是聲音。水聲，滯重的水聲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g6_magnetofluidwaterfall"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人抬起頭，緩慢睜開眼睛。\n他們很快意識到洞內的光亮並不來自外界，它來自眼前地上靜止不動的液體，以及視線盡頭淋漓的——瀑布。\n液體有著黑曜石般的光澤，在下落過程中折射從高處縫隙中透出的光亮，讓洞窟崎嶇的內部明亮得如同下過小雨的清晨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……逆流的河。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看出來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，類似逆流河，“奧卡”本應溢出的部分無法沿傾斜面向外流淌，因此只能往回流，直到像這樣“靜止”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它其實保持著某種程度上的流動性，即使沒有外力影響。這可能也是他們把它命名為“奧卡”的原因，像河流一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡到處都是這種液體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根本看不出這裡是礦洞，簡直就像是一個天然的溶洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更神奇的是，“奧卡”本身，就像是水一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這是什麼意思？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這怎麼可能？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……只是一個比喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沉澱一段時間之後，“奧卡”呈現出的狀態非常穩定，甚至可以被當作通用溶劑使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請等一下！就算是這樣我們也不能直接用手去接觸——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Mon3tr彎腰，用試管從地上收集起一些液體。她沒戴手套，也沒有做任何防護。\n濕漉漉的雙手晃動著試管中的液體，她的表情凝重起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Mon3tr？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr小姐，你不應該直接接觸——我帶了防護設備，你想要樣本的話可以告訴我，讓我來採集！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……博士，我知道這是什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"科謝尼婭，樣本採集……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那能麻煩你去採集一下瀑布那邊的樣本嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就在這裡等我，我很快回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種被稱為“奧卡”的流體……實際上就是“源石”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"為什麼會是這個樣子？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這解釋起來稍微有點複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你還記得萊茵生命研究的“遞質”，或者伊比利亞煉金術中常被提及的“心相原質”嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我記得。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"它們之間有關係嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可能就是它們的原型，或者說原始素材。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"“遞質”和“心相原質”的共通點……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"它們都是某種“媒介”。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，能直接與人體產生反應，或留存資訊的“媒介”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以這兩種產物才都呈現出流體狀態？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認為是這樣的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你應該已經瞭解，源石既是“資訊”的載體，也是“能量”的載體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“遞質”與“心相原質”，都是用特定的手段重新刻錄了源石能量，用以保留不同資訊的產物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而出現在這裡的“奧卡”，是以一種更高效的手段抽光了源石中的能量後，殘餘的空白物質……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，它甚至真的就是一種“通用溶劑”。或許這也可以解釋那些接觸過“奧卡”的感染者為何會出現“變異”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡單來說，“奧卡”作為一種失去了能量的源石，中和了感染者體內的源石活性，同時也為源石的持續生長創造了前所未有的優越條件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這或許能暫時維持感染者的生命徵象，卻無法改變他們注定很快就會死去的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那些被注入了“奧卡”的普通人，由於體內幾乎毫無活性源石，產生了強烈的排異反應，所以無一倖存……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"它大規模地出現在這裡……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"那就代表……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們最應該擔憂的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，科羅薩主礦脈正在枯竭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"……","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們聽到的那些傳聞，烏薩斯正在加快開採源石的速度……實際上是在掩飾礦脈枯竭的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從這裡，烏薩斯最北端的礦區開始，枯竭的速度還會不斷加快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以大概估算出，四個月之內，烏薩斯境內的源石礦蘊藏量將會下降到原有的百分之三十……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這才是女大公封鎖礦區的真正原因。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這件事根本不可能一直隱瞞下去。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"甚至不用問出那個問題，你和Mon3tr對視，腦海中不約而同地浮現出一個名字。\n那唯一一個有能力做到這件事的人的名字——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞賽斯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了她，也不可能有其他人了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她為什麼要這樣做？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦脈枯竭的過程無法被干涉，也無法被逆轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯必定會走向崩潰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"恐怕不只是烏薩斯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這種規模的資源枯竭必然會影響整個泰拉。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"難道這就是她想要的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，博士！我想到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“奧卡”也是前文明的遺留……還是你們曾經實驗的副產物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果礦脈枯竭是因為她做了些什麼，那這裡面可能還存在一些有用的資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你試試看能不能讀取。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我該怎麼……？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的條件有限，直接把你的手放進去，就像我剛才採集樣本時那樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，它不會對你產生傷害的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"按照Mon3tr的指示，你蹲下身，將雙手都沉入名為“奧卡”的液體當中。\n你等待了一下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒感覺到有什麼不同。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你等待著變化，或者回應，就像先前數次發生過的“奇蹟”一樣。\n然而最終卻什麼也沒有發生。\n來自前文明的產物似乎在拒絕、否認你們之間存在某種連繫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們腳下的這些會不會已經失去儲存資訊的功能了？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或者說，她根本不想留資訊給我們。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……唔，也不是不可能。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr小姐、博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點過來，我發現了一些新東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在瀑布後面有個空洞，爬上去，站到那裡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我發現礦洞中存在一種特殊頻率的聲音，它很不自然——不，是絕對不自然！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":"avg_4208_wintim_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就彷彿……它在試圖透過聲波傳達某種資訊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們過去看看。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"瀑布中間還有這樣的地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"確實……很壯觀。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"來，你們仔細聽！在所有液體擊打岩石的聲音裡，總有幾段頻率特別的聲音，彷彿在吸引人注意。它們非常不同，你們一定能聽到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才有試著解讀我聽到的那幾段，花了一點時間，因為要把時高時低的聲音完全記錄下來——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是這個！你們聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只聽到了雨聲！甚至聽不清楚你說的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你只是閉上了雙眼，任由所有的聲音將你包裹。\n直到明確聽到了那不斷變換頻率的聲音。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我聽到了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你是說你聽到了嗎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些陡然闖入知覺的聲音，時而由數段頻率高的聲波組成，時而簡短且凌厲，像一段韻調別緻的樂曲。\n但你很快就確定，它理應是某種編碼，或者是語言。\n你儘力捕捉了自己能回憶起的所有語言，將它們分門別類，一一對應之後，你意識到這只是同個詞語在不同語言中的不同說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我抄寫下來了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只是直覺，但如果按照不同移動城市之間使用的通用編碼規則來辨識這些聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得它應該是一個單詞，是用很多語言寫出來的同一個單詞。我可以認出烏薩斯語和高盧語！我覺得這兩個詞的意思都是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“未知語言”\n……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“спорить”\n“dibattito”\n……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“débat”\n“debate”\n……\n是啊。留在礦井中的流體用敲擊岩石的形式向你傳遞了同一個詞語——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"narration","text":"<color=#000000>“辯論”。</color>\n<color=#000000>“辯論”。</color>"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒錯，Dr.{@nickname}。\n如果你依然認為自己的選擇是正確的。\n如果你依然堅定地相信你描述的未來。\n那就用現實來駁斥我，向我證明……\n你堅持的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“希望”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i06"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……這是一個邀請。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我說，這是一個邀請。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一個我必須接受的邀請。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g6_magnetofluidwaterfall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）你認為這是普瑞賽斯留給你的訊息？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我明白她的意思……","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我們應該儘快撤離了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等科謝尼婭採集完樣本，我們就回研究所吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想個辦法和阿米婭他們取得聯絡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不知道阿米婭他們怎麼樣了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"希望阿米婭已經和Raidian他們取得聯絡了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……你有沒有聽到什麼聲音？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼樣的聲音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"重物踩在水裡移動的聲音。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瀑布的水聲一直很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你確定不是耳鳴嗎？也許是因為剛才需要你大腦同時處理的資訊太多，知覺滯留……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科謝尼婭？是你嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那不是科謝尼婭的腳步聲，體重和節奏都不對。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……什麼——"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g6_magnetofluidwaterfall"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i11"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"癲狂的呼號，急促的呼吸，獠牙之間的黏液不斷滴穿水面。\n暗紅的源石貫穿牠的整個身軀，似乎是由於這堅硬的鉗制，才使牠必須像人一樣站立。\n而後，你看到牠擎起巨大的前掌——\n不，不能說是前掌。因為那完全是一雙乾枯的、人的雙手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"……被源石感染的裂獸。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我採集完樣本了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們……怎麼站在這裡不動？"},{"type":"narration","text":"與認知不符的怪異裂獸正站在她身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"科謝尼婭，快點過來！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"跑，科謝尼婭！往前跑，不要回頭看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我要去帶她回來。博士，你去礦車那邊，我們在那裡會合！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"博士，快走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"narration","text":"研究員奔跑起來的同時，忍不住回頭望去。\n她只來得及吞下尖叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——陛下在上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"科謝尼婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那到底是什麼東西？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
